I don't see any arithmetic issues with the model.

What is happening to your parameters (phi, alpha, and beta_X)
in the chains?

The beta_binomial and other overdispersed models can be hard
to identify --- if the predictors are decently predictive, I
could image phi being difficult to fit.

- Bob

